Three things to have written down before any interview
Your MCP story. You have production MCP experience and almost no other candidate does. Rehearse 90 seconds on what you built, what broke, and what you'd change.
Three production war stories. Rubric Q1's green flag is "talks about what went wrong." What broke, how you found it, what you changed, what you'd do differently. This is the highest-value hour in the whole preparation and nearly nobody does it.
One case where you chose NOT to use an agent. Rubric Q3's green flag. Specific system, specific reasoning.
